title: TESK
abstract: >-
  TESK is an implementation of the GA4GH Task Execution Service (TES) API on
  Kubernetes: its API service (tesk-api) turns each task into Kubernetes jobs,
  which a taskmaster runs, with a filer that stages inputs and outputs
  (tesk-core). This repository holds the Helm chart that deploys TESK and the
  documentation of all three components.
